<title>UK: Sweden sets $80 mln 10-year dual currency bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets $80 mln 10-year dual currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual currency bond</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    $80 MLN	 COUPON    *3.145 PCT MATURITY    20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE  **19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 B.P.   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    * COUPON PAYMENTS IN DOLLARS, BOND REDEEMABLE IN YEN</p>
<p>	    ** LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
